A particle meaning:--
.²1 At all, ever, at any time, possibly; {#nAntarajYAH Sriyo jAtuH priyErAsAM#}
 {#na BUyate#} <ls>Ki. 11. 24</ls>; {#kiM tena jAtu jAtena mAturyOvanahAriRA#} <ls>Pt. 1. 26</ls>;
 {#na jAtu kAmaH kAmAnAmupaBogena SAmyati#} <ls>Ms. 2. 94</ls>; <ls>Ku. 5. 55</ls>.
.²2 Perhaps, sometimes; {#gOravAdyadapi jAtu mantriRAM darSanaM … dadO#} <ls>R. 19. 7</ls>.
.²3 Once, once upon a time, sometime, at some day.
.²4 Used with the potential mood {#jAtu#} has the sense of ‘not allowing
 or putting up with’; {#jAtu tatraBavAn vfzalaM yAjayennAvakalpayAmi#}
 ({#na marzayAmi#}) <ls>Sk.</ls>
.²5 Used with a present indicative it denotes censure ({#garhA#}); {#jAtu#}
 {#tatraBavAn vfzalaM yAjayati#} {%<ab>ibid.</ab>%}
